\item[S2] Peter Keevash and Katherine Staden, The Generalised Oberwolfach Problem, arXiv:2004.09937v1 (2020), Section 1, “Oberwolfach Problem (Ringel)”, page 1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2004.09937v1}.
